# The build context of every image (WP-7): sources only. A small context builds faster, and no
# local secret can reach a layer (ADR-043). Each image builds its own dist inside the build stage.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
docs

# Secrets: every env file, the committed templates too. No image needs them, and an exception
# would also re-include the copies under .claude/worktrees/, whose churn breaks the build cache.
**/.env
**/.env.*
